"}]}</script><nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" class="shell py-3 text-paper/70 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1.5 text-[13px]"><ol class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1.5"><li class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><a href="/" class="transition-colors hover:text-gold">Home</a></li><li class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-right size-3.5 shrink-0 text-paper/40" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"></path></svg><span class="font-medium text-paper" aria-current="page">Strategic Research &amp; Feasibility</span></li></ol></nav></div><main><section class="section-y border-b border-ink-tint bg-ink"><div class="shell"><section data-visible="false" class="reveal max-w-3xl"><h1 class="font-display text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-paper md:text-[3rem]">Research and feasibility studies before you commit capital</h1><p class="mt-5 text-[17px] leading-relaxed text-paper/80">SBC gives promoters, trusts, businesses and consulting firms in Ahmedabad and across Gujarat independent market research and feasibility studies, with a clear go / no-go recommendation, before the money is committed.</p><div class="mt-7 flex flex-wrap gap-3"><a href="https://wa.me/918128310116?text=Hello%20Dr.%20Burse%2C%20I%E2%80%99d%20like%20to%20discuss%20a%20project." target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-gold px-6 py-3 text-[13px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-paper transition-colors hover:bg-gold-tint"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-message-circle size-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2.992 16.342a2 2 0 0 1 .094 1.167l-1.065 3.29a1 1 0 0 0 1.236 1.168l3.413-.998a2 2 0 0 1 1.099.092 10 10 0 1 0-4.777-4.719"></path></svg> WhatsApp Dr. Sagar Burse</a><a href="tel:+918128310116" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 border border-ink-tint px-6 py-3 text-[13px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-paper transition-colors hover:border-gold hover:text-gold"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-phone size-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M13.832 16.568a1 1 0 0 0 1.213-.303l.355-.465A2 2 0 0 1 17 15h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v3a2 2 0 0 1-2 2A18 18 0 0 1 2 4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v3a2 2 0 0 1-.8 1.6l-.468.351a1 1 0 0 0-.292 1.233 14 14 0 0 0 6.392 6.384"></path></svg> Call +91 81283 10116</a></div></section></div></section><section class="section-y border-b border-ink-tint bg-ink-wash"><div class="shell"><section data-visible="false" class="reveal max-w-3xl"><h2 class="font-display text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink md:text-[2.5rem]">Where investment decisions usually go wrong</h2></section><section data-visible="false" class="reveal mt-8 grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2"><div class="border border-ink-tint bg-paper px-4 py-3 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">The plan rests on assumptions about demand, pricing and competition that nobody has tested.</div><div class="border border-ink-tint bg-paper px-4 py-3 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">A generic desk report does not answer the specific decision: this location, this course, this venture.</div><div class="border border-ink-tint bg-paper px-4 py-3 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">Feasibility reports are often written to satisfy a bank or a regulator, not to tell the owner honestly whether to proceed.</div><div class="border border-ink-tint bg-paper px-4 py-3 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">Consulting firms with a client deadline often lack spare capacity for fieldwork and analysis.</div></section></div></section><section class="section-y border-b border-ink-tint"><div class="shell"><section data-visible="false" class="reveal "><h2 class="font-display text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink md:text-[2.5rem]">What We Deliver</h2></section><section data-visible="false" class="reveal mt-8 grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3"><article class="flex h-full flex-col border border-ink-tint bg-card p-5 transition-colors hover:border-gold/60"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-clipboard-list size-6 text-gold" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="8" height="4" x="8" y="2" rx="1" ry="1"></rect><path d="M16 4h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2"></path><path d="M12 11h4"></path><path d="M12 16h4"></path><path d="M8 11h.01"></path><path d="M8 16h.01"></path></svg><h3 class="mt-4 font-display text-lg font-semibold leading-snug text-ink">Feasibility studies</h3><p class="mt-2 flex-1 text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">Business feasibility reports covering market demand, competition, location and financial viability, ending in a clear go / no-go view.</p></article><article class="flex h-full flex-col border border-ink-tint bg-card p-5 transition-colors hover:border-gold/60"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-graduation-cap size-6 text-gold" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M21.42 10.922a1 1 0 0 0-.019-1.838L12.83 5.18a2 2 0 0 0-1.66 0L2.6 9.08a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.832l8.57 3.908a2 2 0 0 0 1.66 0z"></path><path d="M22 10v6"></path><path d="M6 12.5V16a6 3 0 0 0 12 0v-3.5"></path></svg><h3 class="mt-4 font-display text-lg font-semibold leading-snug text-ink">Demand studies for colleges and courses</h3><p class="mt-2 flex-1 text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">Learner and employer demand, and competing providers, so a new college, course or skill programme is sized before it is launched.</p></article><article class="flex h-full flex-col border border-ink-tint bg-card p-5 transition-colors hover:border-gold/60"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-gauge size-6 text-gold" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m12 14 4-4"></path><path d="M3.34 19a10 10 0 1 1 17.32 0"></path></svg><h3 class="mt-4 font-display text-lg font-semibold leading-snug text-ink">Skill gap studies</h3><p class="mt-2 flex-1 text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">Evidence of the gap between what employers need and what local training supplies, for programme design or a funding case.</p></article><article class="flex h-full flex-col border border-ink-tint bg-card p-5 transition-colors hover:border-gold/60"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-users size-6 text-gold" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"></path><path d="M16 3.128a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.744"></path><path d="M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"></path><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"></circle></svg><h3 class="mt-4 font-display text-lg font-semibold leading-snug text-ink">Market and consumer research</h3><p class="mt-2 flex-1 text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">Consumer surveys, interviews and secondary data on customers, competitors and market size, in Ahmedabad and across Gujarat.</p></article><article class="flex h-full flex-col border border-ink-tint bg-card p-5 transition-colors hover:border-gold/60"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-file-text size-6 text-gold" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 22a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h8a2.4 2.4 0 0 1 1.704.706l3.588 3.588A2.4 2.4 0 0 1 20 8v12a2 2 0 0 1-2 2z"></path><path d="M14 2v5a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h5"></path><path d="M10 9H8"></path><path d="M16 13H8"></path><path d="M16 17H8"></path></svg><h3 class="mt-4 font-display text-lg font-semibold leading-snug text-ink">DPRs for colleges, skill centres and ventures</h3><p class="mt-2 flex-1 text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">Detailed project reports that follow a feasibility study, covering design, infrastructure, staffing, costs and timeline.</p></article><article class="flex h-full flex-col border border-ink-tint bg-card p-5 transition-colors hover:border-gold/60"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-handshake size-6 text-gold" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m11 17 2 2a1 1 0 1 0 3-3"></path><path d="m14 14 2.5 2.5a1 1 0 1 0 3-3l-3.88-3.88a3 3 0 0 0-4.24 0l-.88.88a1 1 0 1 1-3-3l2.81-2.81a5.79 5.79 0 0 1 7.06-.87l.47.28a2 2 0 0 0 1.42.25L21 4"></path><path d="m21 3 1 11h-2"></path><path d="M3 3 2 14l6.5 6.5a1 1 0 1 0 3-3"></path><path d="M3 4h8"></path></svg><h3 class="mt-4 font-display text-lg font-semibold leading-snug text-ink">Research support for consulting firms</h3><p class="mt-2 flex-1 text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">Research delivered under your engagement, to your standards and timelines, so your client relationship stays with you.</p></article></section></div></section><section class="section-y border-b border-ink-tint bg-ink-wash"><div class="shell"><section data-visible="false" class="reveal max-w-3xl"><h2 class="font-display text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink md:text-[2.5rem]">How We Work</h2></section><section data-visible="false" class="reveal mt-9"><ol class="divide-y divide-ink-tint border-t border-ink-tint"><li class="flex flex-col gap-3 py-6 sm:flex-row sm:items-start sm:gap-6"><div class="flex shrink-0 items-center gap-3 sm:w-56"><span class="grid size-9 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full border border-gold text-[12px] font-semibold text-gold">01</span><h3 class="text-[13px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-ink">Fixed-fee diagnostic</h3></div><p class="text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal sm:flex-1">We define the decision the research must support, and agree the method, sample and sources in writing, for a fixed fee.</p></li><li class="flex flex-col gap-3 py-6 sm:flex-row sm:items-start sm:gap-6"><div class="flex shrink-0 items-center gap-3 sm:w-56"><span class="grid size-9 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full border border-gold text-[12px] font-semibold text-gold">02</span><h3 class="text-[13px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-ink">Research</h3></div><p class="text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal sm:flex-1">Primary fieldwork (surveys and interviews) and secondary data, checked and verified before analysis.</p></li><li class="flex flex-col gap-3 py-6 sm:flex-row sm:items-start sm:gap-6"><div class="flex shrink-0 items-center gap-3 sm:w-56"><span class="grid size-9 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full border border-gold text-[12px] font-semibold text-gold">03</span><h3 class="text-[13px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-ink">Report and recommendation</h3></div><p class="text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal sm:flex-1">Findings, risks and a clear go / no-go recommendation, presented to you directly.</p></li></ol></section></div></section><section class="section-y border-b border-ink-tint"><div class="shell"><section data-visible="false" class="reveal max-w-3xl"><p class="text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-gold">Case summary · Strategic Feasibility · Completed</p><h2 class="mt-2 font-display text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink md:text-[2.5rem]">Is a luxury coffee brand viable in India?</h2></section><section data-visible="false" class="reveal mt-8 grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-3"><article class="border border-ink-tint bg-card p-6"><h3 class="text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-ink-soft">The problem</h3><p class="mt-3 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">A prospective entrepreneur was evaluating a premium coffee venture combining a flagship café, in-house roasting, direct-to-consumer coffee, subscriptions and sustainable home coffee.</p></article><article class="border border-ink-tint bg-card p-6"><h3 class="text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-ink-soft">The work done</h3><p class="mt-3 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">SBC assessed the Indian coffee market and consumer behaviour, competitive benchmarks, positioning, business models, and investment and financial feasibility.</p></article><article class="border border-ink-tint bg-card p-6"><h3 class="text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-ink-soft">The outcome</h3><p class="mt-3 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">A feasibility framework and phased roadmap covering market opportunity, positioning, business model, investment needs, financial feasibility and risks, with scaling tied to defined commercial triggers.</p></article></section><div data-visible="false" class="reveal mt-6"><a href="/case-studies/luxury-coffee-brand-feasibility" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-gold-deep transition-colors hover:text-gold">Read the full case study →</a><p class="mt-3 text-[13px] italic leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">Client identity is withheld for confidentiality. References available on request.</p></div></div></section><section class="section-y border-b border-ink-tint bg-ink-wash"><div class="shell"><section data-visible="false" class="reveal "><h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink">SBC Engagements</h2></section><section data-visible="false" class="reveal mt-8 grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2"><article class="flex flex-col border border-ink-tint bg-card p-6"><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3"><p class="text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-gold-deep">Strategic Research</p><span class="shrink-0 px-2.5 py-1 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.1em] bg-ink/10 text-ink">Completed</span></div><h3 class="mt-3 font-display text-lg font-semibold leading-snug text-ink">Café Feasibility Study</h3><p class="mt-3 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">Feasibility study for a new café venture.</p><p class="mt-4 text-[12px] italic leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">Client references available on request.</p><a href="/case-studies/cafe-feasibility-study" class="mt-4 inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-gold-deep transition-colors hover:text-gold">View details <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right size-3.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a></article><article class="flex flex-col border border-ink-tint bg-card p-6"><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3"><p class="text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-gold-deep">Strategic Research</p><span class="shrink-0 px-2.5 py-1 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.1em] bg-ink/10 text-ink">Completed</span></div><h3 class="mt-3 font-display text-lg font-semibold leading-snug text-ink">Accounts Outsourcing Market Study</h3><p class="mt-3 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">Market study delivered as research partner to a consulting firm.</p><p class="mt-4 text-[12px] italic leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">Client references available on request.</p><a href="/case-studies/accounts-outsourcing-market-study" class="mt-4 inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-gold-deep transition-colors hover:text-gold">View details <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right size-3.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a></article></section><div data-visible="false" class="reveal mt-6"><a href="/case-studies" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-gold-deep transition-colors hover:text-gold">View all case studies →</a></div></div></section><section class="section-y border-b border-ink-tint bg-ink-wash"><div class="shell"><section data-visible="false" class="reveal max-w-3xl"><h2 class="font-display text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink md:text-[2.5rem]">About Dr. Sagar Burse</h2><div class="mt-5 space-y-4 text-[17px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal"><p>Dr. Sagar Burse holds a PhD in Management and leads every SBC study personally. You speak to the person who designs the research and presents the findings, not to a sales team.</p><p>SBC’s research work includes feasibility studies for new ventures and a market study delivered as research partner to a consulting firm.</p></div><a href="/founder" class="mt-5 inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-gold-deep transition-colors hover:text-gold">Read Dr. Burse’s full profile →</a></section></div></section><section class="section-y border-b border-ink-tint"><div class="shell"><style>.faq-item summary{list-style:none}.faq-item summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}.faq-item .faq-chev{transition:transform .2s}.faq-item[open] .faq-chev{transform:rotate(180deg)}.faq-item summary:focus-visible{outline:2px solid currentColor;outline-offset:-2px}</style><div class="grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,0.9fr)_minmax(0,1.4fr)] lg:items-start"><section data-visible="false" class="reveal "><h2 id="faq" class="font-display text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink md:text-[2.5rem]">Questions we are asked before a study</h2><p class="mt-4 text-[17px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">Tap a question to see the answer.</p></section><div class="space-y-4"><details name="faq" class="faq-item border border-ink-tint bg-card"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-4 p-5"><h3 class="font-display text-lg font-semibold leading-snug text-ink">What is the difference between a feasibility study and a DPR?</h3><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down faq-chev size-4 shrink-0 text-gold" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></summary><div class="border-t border-ink-tint p-5"><p class="text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">A feasibility study answers whether to proceed: demand, competition, location and financial viability. A DPR is the detailed plan that follows: design, infrastructure, staffing, costs and timeline, often needed by a regulator, bank or funding body. We do both, and a feasibility study often becomes the first part of the DPR.</p></div></details><details name="faq" class="faq-item border border-ink-tint bg-card"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-4 p-5"><h3 class="font-display text-lg font-semibold leading-snug text-ink">How long does a feasibility study or market research project take?</h3><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down faq-chev size-4 shrink-0 text-gold" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></summary><div class="border-t border-ink-tint p-5"><p class="text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">It depends on the scope and on whether primary fieldwork is needed. After the fixed-fee diagnostic you receive a written timeline for your study, so the schedule is agreed before the full project starts.</p></div></details><details name="faq" class="faq-item border border-ink-tint bg-card"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-4 p-5"><h3 class="font-display text-lg font-semibold leading-snug text-ink">Will you tell us if the idea should not go ahead?</h3><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down faq-chev size-4 shrink-0 text-gold" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></summary><div class="border-t border-ink-tint p-5"><p class="text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">Yes. Each study ends with a clear go / no-go recommendation and the risks behind it, including when the answer is not what the promoter hoped for.</p></div></details><details name="faq" class="faq-item border border-ink-tint bg-card"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-4 p-5"><h3 class="font-display text-lg font-semibold leading-snug text-ink">Do you work with consulting firms and research agencies?</h3><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down faq-chev size-4 shrink-0 text-gold" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></summary><div class="border-t border-ink-tint p-5"><p class="text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">Yes. We act as a research partner under your engagement, to your standards and timelines. Your client relationship stays with you.</p></div></details><details name="faq" class="faq-item border border-ink-tint bg-card"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-4 p-5"><h3 class="font-display text-lg font-semibold leading-snug text-ink">What do you need from us to begin?</h3><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down faq-chev size-4 shrink-0 text-gold" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></summary><div class="border-t border-ink-tint p-5"><p class="text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">The decision you are trying to make, the location or segment, your budget range, any data you already hold and your deadline. A short call with Dr. Sagar is enough to start.</p></div></details></div></div></div></section><section id="contact" class="section-y border-b border-ink-tint bg-gold-wash"><div class="shell"><div class="grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,0.9fr)_minmax(0,1.3fr)] lg:items-start"><section data-visible="false" class="reveal "><h2 class="font-display text-3xl font-semibold leading-tight tracking-tight text-ink md:text-[2.5rem]">Talk to Dr. Sagar Burse</h2><p class="mt-4 text-[17px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">Tell us the decision you are weighing. You will speak directly with Dr. Sagar Burse, not a sales team.</p><div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-3"><a href="https://wa.me/918128310116?text=Hello%20Dr.%20Burse%2C%20I%E2%80%99d%20like%20to%20discuss%20a%20project." target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-gold px-6 py-3 text-[13px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-paper transition-colors hover:bg-gold-tint"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" vie